 }
 
-// TODO: there is no real session handling yet — the dashboard just picks the first user.
+// Backed by the signed-in Clerk session. Clerk's user id is the source of
+// truth; on first sight of a given id we lazily create (or otherwise match by
+// email) a row in our own in-memory user list, so the rest of the app keeps
